Constructs a sentinel. Overload \fB(3)\fP is called by end() of ranges::join_with_view.

                  Overload                     end_
                  \fB(1)\fP      value-initialized
                  \fB(2)\fP      initialized with std::move(s.end_ ﻿)
                  \fB(3)\fP      initialized with ranges::end(parent.base_ ﻿)

.SH Parameters

